<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font style="" size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo" style="text-align: center;"></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: left;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: left;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="" size="2">Hi&nbsp;{!Affected_Passenger__c.FirstName__c},</font></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">We’d like to provide an update following your experience on flight {!Affected_Passenger__c.FlightNumber__c} from {!Affected_Passenger__c.Departure_Port_Name__c} to {!Affected_Passenger__c.Arrival_Port_Name__c} on {!Affected_Passenger__c.Schedule_Departure_Date__c}.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2"><br></font></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Affected_Passenger__c.EmailContent__c}</font></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">{!Affected_Passenger__c.EmailFooter__c}<br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></div><div style=""><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Kind regards,</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></p><p style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Ben Coughlin</font></p><p style=""><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;">Executive Manager, Customer Care</span></p><p style="color: rgb(32, 31, 30); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><p style="color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;" align="center"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: black;">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</span><span style="color: black;"></span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;" align="center"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: black;">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</span><span style="color: black;"></span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;" align="center"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: black;"><br></span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);" align="cente