 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: black;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by&nbsp;reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span><span style="color: black;"></span></font></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: black;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></span></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div>]]></td>
